WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Miss An, Young Master and Second Young Master

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,520
See Er Shao

3
00:00:05,020 --> 00:00:06,900
Everyone, brothers, I'm sorry.

4
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,220
I'm going to make you risk your lives again

5
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,660
If the second young master is there, you know where we are and we will fight.

6
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:14,400
We took An Zha's money

7
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,120
life is yours

8
00:00:16,720 --> 00:00:18,040
Work hard for money

9
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:19,680
Thousands of dollars' worth of justice

10
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:25,750
I, Anping, am a businessman. I like money and only recognize money.

11
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:27,150
Because he can buy it for me

12
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:28,230
everything i want

13
00:00:28,630 --> 00:00:29,710
including your lives

14
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:32,040
I am not Chen Haoyu

15
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,360
Looking for a fight and using loyalty as a cover

16
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:41,510
Using brother please as an excuse is a waste of time

17
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:43,710
Call everyone here today

18
00:00:44,910 --> 00:00:46,150
I pay

19
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:48,060
You risk your lives
